"option_label": "Select Design",
"claim": "Under the assumption that printed labels are the authoritative rating-share values, Design's 52% label is numerically greater than all other labels (45%, 39%, 32%, 24%, 10%), making Design the highest current labeled rating share category and supporting the selection of 'Select Design'."
},
{
"chain_id": "base_c2",
