"ref": "public_task",
"path": "/option_labels/1",
"content": "Select Quality"
},
{
"ref": "public_task",
"path": "/option_labels/2",
"content": "Select Support"
}
],
"claim_kind": "underdetermined",
"option_label": null,
"claim": "The chart contains six categories (Quality, Price, Design, Support, Delivery, Other), but the public option_labels only include Design, Quality, and Support. If the highest-share category were Price, Delivery, or Other under any interpretation, it could not be selected. Under the label-based reading, Design is available; under the axis-based reading, Quality is available. The constraint does not resolve the conflict but confirms that only Design, Quality, or Support can be the final selection."
}
